{
 "name": "Dancing Sword — fired trigger at Yes: 2/1 Construct artifact creature with flying and ward {1}, not an Equipment",
 "notes": "Memory: project_may_action_behind_toggle_2026-10-11 (follow-up). \"You may have this Equipment become a 2/1 Construct artifact creature with flying and ward {1}. If you do, it isn't an Equipment.\" \"This Equipment\" before \"becomes\" was not read as the permanent itself (every effect was global with a junk filter and changed nothing), \"It isn't an Equipment\" took the whole line as its subject, and \"ward {1}\" was dropped from the keyword list. At Yes the Sword is a 2/1 Construct with flying and ward {1} and has lost the Equipment subtype; no other permanent changes.",
